      "contextBefore": "Line dash phase specifies how far into the dash pattern the line starts.",
      "contextAfter": "The following code shows how you can create a “marching ant” effect by adding an animation to a shape layer that animates its [`lineDashPhase`](cashapelayer/linedashphase.md) from `0` to the sum of the segment lengths of its [`lineDashPattern`](cashapelayer/linedashpattern.md).",
